# Wrangler's local state and secrets. .wrangler and !.dev.vars.example are the only two
# lines that existed anywhere outside main: they came from the Cloudflare bot's June
# starter commit on cloudflare/workers-autoconfig, whose wrangler.jsonc was long since
# superseded by the real one here. Carried over so that branch could be deleted without
# losing anything.
